        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "December 12 //  9pm $30 + fees The holigays are upon us and Fluffy Souffle is hosting a winter solstice party home homo on the range. Expect a whole host of talent from the Steers &amp; Queers stable at this potluck. &hellip;"
