    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Friday, May 13 // 7-10PM // Free Poz-TO is excited to announce the return of MINGLE to Buddies In Bad Times Theatre on May 13th from 7-10 PM. Hosted by Jade Elektra with a special performance by Toronto’s Kalyssa! No …"
