        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "RWACpod present \"rebel.\" NEON 90's — Buddies in Bad Times Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Rebel without a Closet (@rwacpod) proudly presents \"Rebel\" NEON 90's From SWEET DREAMS to SAVAGE GARDEN, we're heading back to the '90s to relive (or re-discover) all the biggest hits up to 1999! 90's themed outfits HIGHLY ENCOURAGED. Featuring DJ D’STEW (@dj_dstew) spinning an incredible 90's masterpiece ALL NIGHT LONG!! With special performances by Rebel Royalty Carlotta Carlisle (@carlottacarlisle)"
      }
    ],
