        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Miss Gay Northern Star Pageant — Buddies in Bad Times Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The first ever Canadian Prelim for The Miss Gay United States Pageantry System. Contestants compete for a chance to represent all of Canada at The National competition in March of 2023. Come cheer on your favourite queens as they impress our judges with talent and fashion! With performances by some of Toronto's top Drag queens and Canada's Drag Race Alumni Anastarzia Anaquway and Kimora Amour."
      }
    ],
