    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Playhouse Collective is back with a brand new cabaret that you're sure to love. There are so many parts that we’d love to play (and that we'd absolutely KILL) that are just out of reach. But what happens when we get to play our dream roles regardless of gender, age or size? Join us at Buddies in Bad Times' cabaret space while we prove that these parts are ours for the taking.This is a musical cabaret fundraiser for The Playhouse Collective’s upcoming season.CAST:Annie WangCallan ForresterClaire Haig HalsallDeanna MannFernando Martins RossiKevin ForsterLizzie SongMikayla DovellShannon MurtaghSydney PageTori WallerCREATIVE TEAM:Producer: Callan ForresterDirectors: Sydney Page and Callan ForresterMusical Directors: Annie Wang and Deanna Mann"
      }
    ],
