  {
    "@id": "https://buddiesinbadtimes.com/event/amateur-strip-night-judged-by-drag-queens-welcome-back/",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#locale": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "en_US"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#type": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "article"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Amateur Strip Night Judged by Drag Queens - Welcome Back! — Buddies in Bad Times Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "IF YOU AIN’T SHOWIN IT, WE AIN'T THROWING YOU A WELCOME BACK PARTY.We invite you to a night of amateur strip / performance art for cash with fierce judgement by people who are going to welcome you back with a hard enough hug that will crush you to an inch of your life.Amateur Strip Night Judged by Drag Queens is an event we are blessed to witness the flithest strip acts you can imagine from your local pervs. This includes you. Yes you! You can do a strip for a ridiculously supportive audience. Your not-so-technical judges do what they do best - form opinions. The top winners receive cash prizes and hot glued trophies. Every performer receives cab fare + free admission for them & a friend + a drink ticket. What a time to be alive!In terms of ‘strip’ – we are open to wide interpretation. Acts that adhere to the theme are given a leg up in judging, but you don't have to limit yourself! The more ridiculous the better. All genders & orientations encouraged. It's body-posi, queer-posi, all posi.Hosted & Judged by @allysinchaynes, @wigzaddy, and @bathhousebodyworksDJ @bliptor2.0Stage Kitten @delirios.drag///Doors at 10:303 Sets of 4 Performers, lil' intermissions in between.Set times are 11:30pm + 12:15am + 1:00amWinner announced after 2am$200 to the winner$100 to the shoulda been the winner$50 to the shoulda been the should been the winner$20 cab fare to anyone who participatesAll performers get a plus one and a drink ticket!/////Want to sign up?Submit right herehttps://docs.google.com/forms/d/1qk37wy5RIUgdlvk_Cq9p_PsN3vy8ofJpgAz6SQrCveo/At our new home at Buddies in Bad Times! This has been a dream of ours. We no longer have to use a billiard table as a changing room. We are moving up in the world to am amazing ideal setting. Performers will have access to the changing room!/////$12 Cover at the Door$2 of each ticket is used to fund Buddies in Bad Times Capital Improvement Fund"
      }
    ],
