      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Les Femmes Fatales: Beloved — Buddies in Bad Times Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Beloved, inspired by the classic book by the iconic Toni Morrison.Beloved is an exploration of stubbornness, survivorship, dangerous and daring women and the ghostly hauntings. Interpreted through the sensual artforms of burlesque and performance art.Cast:IvoryIrmita La DulceRavynKimora KoiOla MinouGuest Performer : Petra Queen of the NileCurated and produced by Dainty SmithMusic by DJ RelentlessCover model: IvoryPhotography: SlyplaystudiosPoster art: Hilary Pullan"
      }
    ],
