    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A Night at the Bronze - A Buffy the Vampire Slayer Tribute — Buddies in Bad Times Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "We're FINALLY BACK and can't wait to Walk Through The Fire with you all!Calling all Buffy fans and theatre lovers alike! Join us on All Hallows Eve Eve Eve... Eve as we do a live read through of one of Joss Whedon’s most beloved episodes of his most beloved show! A cast of comedians and actors read and sing-through the entire episode of Once More With Feeling. Want to sing along? Absolutely! Lyrics will be provided so “you can sing along”! Join us for this fun-filled, satirical performance of the cult classic! Starting at 10pm, the night will turn into a party at the Bronze – Buddies in Bad Times transforms into everyone’s favourite iconic teen bar (except you have to be of legal age to drink at ours!) Dance the night away with all your favourite Scoobies to all the 90s classics and live out your Buffy fantasies!Costumes encouraged!Buddies In Bad Times TheatreTWO SHOWS followed by a dance party at The Bronze!Friday October 28th – 7:00pm + 9:00pmDance party starts at 10:30pm!$35 – Show and 90’s Vampire Dance Party*$20 – Dance Party Only (only available at the door at 10:30pm)*Artsworker/Front Line Worker discount available - inquire at box office directlyCast To Be Announced Soon!This is an all ages event until the dance party, which is 19+.Proof of vaccination requiredAny questions can be directed to cardboardswordcollective@gmail.com"
      }
    ],
