  {
    "@id": "https://buddiesinbadtimes.com/event/show-tell-a-belles-babes-alumni-showcase/",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#locale": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "en_US"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#type": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "article"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Show & Tell! A Belle's Babes Alumni Showcase — Buddies in Bad Times Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Show and Tell is going to be an evening of celebration! Several of Belle Jumelles’ Level 2 Burlesque students never got the chance to showcase their acts back in 2020, due to the early onset of Covid. Since regulations have relaxed a little (NO COVID ISN’T OVER), we’re gonna finally take some of those acts to the stage!Not only will you have the chance to see some burlesque babes do their thing for the first time, but they will also be joined by some of Belle’s Babeliest Alumni students - performers who have taken the burlesque community by storm in the last few years!Can you believe it?!! So much awesome all in one show!!!!So, please join us in the Cabaret Space of Buddies in Bad Times Theatre for one night only!  Wednesday, December 7, 2022Doors at 7:30pmShow at 8:00pm  Featuring:Miss DiamondSoftservveCleo TantraPoly ArmouryBig TroubleRegina RoyaleRed Tongued RavenBlack SmokeMadame Odemin SurpriseTitus Androgynous and Ivory Seating LimitedTickets $25 (advanced) $35 (at the door - if still available)Available through the Buddies in Bad Times Box OfficeCOVID-19 Safety For more information regarding Buddies’ COVID-19 safety policy, visit https://buddiesinbadtimes.com/covid-safety/ Please stay home if you are experiencing any cold symptoms. YES - event if you have tested negative to Covid. We hope you will make wize choices and if you feel up to it, you will join us in gathering with our queer communities to celebrate our bodies in a night of magical Neo Burlesque! Accessibility Information:Possibly using a smoke machine and strobe lights during the showEnglish to ASL Interpretation will not be available during this showThis venue is wheelchair accessibleThis venue is scent freeThis venue has one washroom for all gendersIf you would like to request any accommodations, or if you have any questions, please message Belle Jumelles directly at bellejumellesburlesque@gmail.com"
      }
    ],
