        "@value": "January 19th, 2023 // Doors 7:00pm // Show 7:30pm Regular $25 // Students &amp; Seniors $15 // Artsworkers $10 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The Bruisers&#8217; is a non-secular HALLELUJAH, as in: &#8220;WHOO-HOO, THIS MIGHT SOON BE OVER!&#8221; &nbsp; You are invited &hellip;"
      }
