        "@value": "The event, Vibe and Verse, will feature an intimate screening of the spoken word anthology, Voetry. This edition of Voetry explores four themes: love, resilience, identity, and trauma, through the work of eight local spoken word poets. The evening will include a reception with food and drink, the film screening, a Q&A session, an open mic opportunity, and a closing champagne toast. Attendees will receive complimentary food and one glass of champagne."
      }
    ],
