        "@value": "Doors 6:30pm // Show 7:00pm // Free Admission &nbsp; Black Ties are a series of  yearly events designed to create sustainable relationships within Toronto’s community of Black Theatre Professionals. They are an opportunity for Black Actors, Directors, Playwrights, Producers, Designers, &hellip;"
      }
