        "@value": "Les Femmes Fatales Present Showgirls! Bump and Grind.Celebrating mid-century showgirls, showbabes, showponies , a classic bump and grind, unapologetic shimmying, shakin'  and werkin' it show.Showgirls is all about our fierceness, our toughness, softness, survivorship, resiliency, our softness, glamour and beauty.Starring....Dolly BerlinBelle JumellesSweet DelilahCat ZaddyViolet VixenImogenQuestGuest performers:Bellamie BeastlyRita Ann'tiqueMusic by Dj RelentlessCurated and produced by Dainty Smith.*poster and poster by SlyplaystudiosModel: Dolly Berlin"
