        "@value": "Promotional image for Discow. The backdrop is a disco ball spinning under low flashing lights. The title text reads “Discow”, the letters are filled in with cow spots, outlined by a neon strip. The “o” is a disco ball. Above the title is a cowboy hat graphic outlined by the neon strip. Text reads: “A disco cowboy dance party. Friday April 28. Doors at 10:30 pm.”"
