    "http://schema.org/caption": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Promotional image for Easter 2.0. The backdrop is an illustrated landscape composed of a green grass field, flowers, a blue sky, flying birds, and the sun. The foreground of the image includes 3 performers aligned one behind the other. The performer at the front of the formation is DJ Sophie Jones, a medium skin toned person wearing a fluffy, big collared jacket. Behind DJ Sophie is Jelly, a medium-dark skin toned drag performer wearing an open vest. Behind Jelly is Boa, a light skin toned drag performer wearing a corset, fishnet tights, and a halo. Text reads: “Pop Presents Easter 2.0. Hosted by Boa. The Second Cumming Dance Party. April 15. Doors 10:30pm. 10 dollars before 11pm, 15 dollars after. Buddies in Bad Times Theatre.”"
      }
    ]
