        "@value": "Doors 6:30pm // Show 7:00pm // Free Admission &nbsp; This month POZ-TO &amp; POZPLANET Magazine are partnering with FIFE House to raise awareness and funds to support our homeless HIV+ Community. There&#8217;s no cover but we will be accepting donations &hellip;"
