        "@value": "Doors Open &amp; Sign-up 4:30PM // Open Mic 5PM &nbsp; Join host Raymond Helkio for some of Toronto&#8217;s most dazzling, brazen, saucy, shameless, flashy and flamboyant poets! In order to give everyone a chance to read, please read one work &hellip;"
      }
