        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "JUNE 6-9, 8PM // $45 Canada-Ireland Foundation and Buddies present a THISISPOPBABY and Abbey Theatre co-production Queen of Ireland Panti Bliss is bringing her smash hit show If These Wigs Could Talk to Buddies. Meet notorious drag queen Panti at 54, after a lifetime of accidental activism, &hellip;"
