      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "May 28 // 7:30PM // $18 96-year-old Jewish drag queer grandmother, Nana Schewitz, is ready to live out her final days in Florida, but is Florida ready for her? Florida! Ya Kill Me! is a one-woman theater show, following Berlin-based 96-year-old …"
