    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "May 16 // 7PM // $10 Howdy and WELCOME TO SPURS NIGHT! SPURS is an evening of queer line dancing happening weekly at Owls Club in Toronto, as well as at CHAMPS BAR in Montréal. It was created by Canadian-born …"
