    "http://schema.org/caption": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A tap dancer poses with her arms across her body to the side and her right leg in the air behind her left leg. She has long black curly hair in a ponytail and wears an orange top with flaired sleeves, black pants, and navy blue tap shoes. She poses in front of an orange gradient background -- as if she is about to break into tap dance."
      }
