      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "October 30, 2024 // 8pm // Bar Open 6:30pm FREE EVENT Haven’t had enough of Queer Broadway Karaoke? We’re excited to hear all your most macabre broadway favourites on the Tallulah’s cabaret stage! Your favourite host @neta.j.rose will be joining …"
