        "@value": "October 30, 2024 // 8pm // Bar Open 6:30pm FREE EVENT Haven&#8217;t had enough of Queer Broadway Karaoke? We&#8217;re excited to hear all your most macabre broadway favourites on the Tallulah&#8217;s cabaret stage! Your favourite host @neta.j.rose will be joining &hellip;"
