      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/caption": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The image shows two people in a go-kart, seemingly mid-race. Their faces appear to be edited onto the bodies of racers, giving it a playful, surreal look. The person on the left has colorful, pink-and-blue hair and is wearing vibrant earrings, while the person on the right has a dramatically surprised facial expression with raised eyebrows and an open mouth. Both wear racing jumpsuits and gloves as they grip the kart’s steering wheels. The background shows an indoor go-kart track with other racers behind them. Above the scene, bold, colorful text reads: \"SUPER MARIO KART\" in a playful, blocky, retro style reminiscent of classic video games. Below, in a pixelated font, it says: \"A MARIO KART TOURNAMENT @BUDDIES IN BAD TIMES.\" Additionally, the names \"Roz Poutine\" and \"Devery Bess\" are written in yellow text above each person, identifying the racers. The lighting has a slightly cool, industrial feel, with greenish overhead lights, and the setting is clearly an indoor parking-garage-style go-kart track. The overall tone is playful and energetic, blending the nostalgia of Mario Kart with drag and humor."
      }
    ]
  },
