        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "May 28, 2025  // 6:30pm FREE “On Wednesday May 28, Queer Broadway Karaoke is back for all your nerdy needs! Come out to sing Sondheim, wail Webber, belt Brown, shriek Schwartz…how many more of these can I come up with?! …"
