    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "May 28, 2025  // 6:30pm FREE &#8220;On Wednesday May 28, Queer Broadway Karaoke is back for all your nerdy needs! Come out to sing Sondheim, wail Webber, belt Brown, shriek Schwartz&#8230;how many more of these can I come up with?! &hellip;"
