        "@value": "September 20 // Doors @ 9pm $15 BIPOC tickets // $20 General // $25 Door all prices + fees We heard bisexuals are all greedy for attention…? BI BI BABY is back to celebrate BI VISIBILITY DAY and we’re turning our eyes …"
